                <pb facs="0675" n="625" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg625"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Taylor to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-12-17"><hi rendition="#italic">December 17,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Telegram read to minister of state, who promises to urge minister for the
                    colonies, with whom I have spoken, to so rearrange Cuban tariff as to secure to
                    us the most-favored-nation treatment. Answer promised soon.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
